    "ADVANTAGES",
    "Free training for beginners",
    "During the tour, we will teach you everything from the basics of clutch operation and gear shifting to confidently overcoming obstacles on an off-road bike.",
    "Category A driver's license is not required",
    "It's advisable to have an IDP for safe driving. But let's be honest, we're in Vietnam, and the police here are very lenient towards tourists.",
    "Trails of any complexity",
    "Vietnam is an enduro paradise: misty mountains, waterfalls, tea plantations, and hidden trails. We'll tailor a route to suit you—from easy beginner routes with panoramic views to hardcore pro routes with adrenaline-pumping descents and challenges!",
    "Simple booking",
    "We've made our service as simple as possible so you can enjoy your motorcycle trip worry-free. We offer some of the most competitive prices.",
